WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:33.355
[Shimmering Synth-Pop Intro]

00:00:33.355 --> 00:00:38.500
The water runs, the towel is warm

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.204
Washing off the lingering storm

00:00:43.204 --> 00:00:48.969
The heavy scent of diesel fumes

00:00:49.409 --> 00:00:54.314
Replaced by soap in quiet rooms

00:00:54.314 --> 00:00:59.520
[Gentle Instrumental Pause]

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:05.000
"Lift your arms," a gentle sound

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.500
My feet are hovering off the ground

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:16.500
The wet and cold are peeled away

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.317
To face the light of this new day

00:01:20.337 --> 00:01:26.262
In the Airside Sanctuary

00:01:29.137 --> 00:01:33.500
The world is soft and light

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.500
No more shadows, no more scary

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.042
Fragments of the night

00:01:45.163 --> 00:01:48.825
I'm clean, I'm dry, I'm safe, I'm here

00:01:48.845 --> 00:01:51.500
Watching the gray clouds disappear

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.000
Airside...

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Safe inside...

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.896
[Instrumental Interlude]

00:02:02.896 --> 00:02:08.500
The door is locked, but I'm not trapped

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:16.000
The map of hell has been re-mapped

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:23.000
You turn to me, you meet my eyes

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:30.670
No anger there, no heavy sighs

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:36.000
"Do you mind?" you softly ask

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:42.204
Removing one more heavy mask

00:02:42.244 --> 00:02:46.500
You give me space, you give me choice

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.851
You give me back my stolen voice

00:02:49.851 --> 00:02:58.378
[Instrumental Swell]

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:02.062
In the Airside Sanctuary

00:03:05.024 --> 00:03:09.500
The world is soft and light

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:13.000
No more shadows, no more scary

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.411
Fragments of the night

00:03:21.035 --> 00:03:24.737
I'm clean, I'm dry, I'm safe, I'm here

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:29.500
Watching the gray clouds disappear

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.500
Airside...

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:35.901
Safe inside...

00:03:35.901 --> 00:03:46.983
[Cinematic Synth Bridge Swells]

00:03:46.983 --> 00:03:54.324
Ticket in my pocket, "Gateway" on the wing

00:03:54.384 --> 00:03:59.500
Boarding Group A, the finest thing

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:04.000
A miracle of time and chance

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.023
A victory in a single glance

00:04:07.384 --> 00:04:13.611
The busiest day of all the year

00:04:13.611 --> 00:04:18.816
But somehow, we are sitting here...

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:30.000
Turn my chair to face the glass

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:36.500
Watch the heavy shadows pass

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:42.500
The engines roar, the birds take flight

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:47.327
Into the morning light...

00:04:49.768 --> 00:04:51.648
Just hold me...

00:04:56.176 --> 00:04:58.043
Just hold me...

00:04:58.043 --> 00:05:09.280
[Jet Engine Takeoff Drone Fades Out]
